  ('TRIBE', 'Revelation 5:5', 'See, the Lion of the tribe of Judah, the Root of David, has triumphed.', NOW()),
  ('TRIES', 'Psalm 17:3', 'Though you probe my heart, though you examine me at night and test me, you will find that I have planned no evil.', NOW()),
  ('TYING', 'Mark 11:2', 'Go to the village ahead of you, and just as you enter it, you will find a colt tied there.', NOW()),
  ('UNION', 'Ephesians 4:3', 'Make every effort to keep the unity of the Spirit through the bond of peace.', NOW()),
