  ('VALID', 'John 8:17', 'In your own Law it is written that the testimony of two witnesses is true.', NOW()),
  ('VALOR', 'Joshua 1:9', 'Have I not commanded you? Be strong and courageous. Do not be afraid; do not be discouraged.', NOW()),
  ('VERSE', 'Psalm 119:11', 'I have hidden your word in my heart that I might not sin against you.', NOW()),
  ('VEXED', 'Psalm 6:3', 'My soul is in deep anguish. How long, LORD, how long?', NOW()),
  ('VINES', 'John 15:5', 'I am the vine; you are the branches. If you remain in me and I in you, you will bear much fruit.', NOW()),
  ('VOICE', 'John 10:27', 'My sheep listen to my voice; I know them, and they follow me.', NOW()),
  ('VOWED', 'Numbers 30:2', 'When a man makes a vow to the LORD or takes an oath to obligate himself by a pledge, he must not break his word.', NOW()),
  ('WALKS', 'Micah 6:8', 'And what does the LORD require of you? To act justly and to love mercy and to walk humbly with your God.', NOW()),
  ('WALLS', 'Nehemiah 4:6', 'So we rebuilt the wall till all of it reached half its height, for the people worked with all their heart.', NOW()),
  ('WANTS', '1 Timothy 2:4', 'Who wants all people to be saved and to come to a knowledge of the truth.', NOW()),
  ('WASTE', 'Isaiah 58:12', 'Your people will rebuild the ancient ruins and will raise up the age-old foundations.', NOW()),
  ('WAVES', 'Matthew 14:29', 'Then Peter got down out of the boat, walked on the water and came toward Jesus.', NOW()),
  ('WEARS', 'Colossians 3:12', 'Therefore, as God''s chosen people, holy and dearly loved, clothe yourselves with compassion, kindness, humility, gentleness and patience.', NOW()),
  ('WEARY', 'Isaiah 40:31', 'But those who hope in the LORD will renew their strength. They will soar on wings like eagles; they will run and not grow weary, they will walk and not be faint.', NOW()),
  ('WELLS', 'Isaiah 12:3', 'With joy you will draw water from the wells of salvation.', NOW()),
  ('WHOLE', 'Deuteronomy 6:5', 'Love the LORD your God with all your heart and with all your soul and with all your strength.', NOW()),
  ('WILLS', 'Matthew 6:10', 'Your kingdom come, your will be done, on earth as it is in heaven.', NOW()),
  ('WINDS', 'Psalm 104:4', 'He makes winds his messengers, flames of fire his servants.', NOW()),
  ('WINGS', 'Psalm 91:4', 'He will cover you with his feathers, and under his wings you will find refuge; his faithfulness will be your shield and rampart.', NOW()),
  ('WINES', 'John 2:10', 'And he said to him, Everyone serves the good wine first, and when people have drunk freely, then the poor wine. But you have kept the good wine until now.', NOW()),
  ('WISER', 'Proverbs 9:9', 'Instruct the wise and they will be wiser still; teach the righteous and they will add to their learning.', NOW()),
  ('WITTY', 'Proverbs 8:12', 'I, wisdom, dwell together with prudence; I possess knowledge and discretion.', NOW()),
  ('WOMEN', 'Luke 8:3', 'And Joanna the wife of Chuza, the manager of Herod''s household; Susanna; and many others. These women were helping to support them out of their own means.', NOW()),
  ('WORDS', 'Psalm 19:14', 'May these words of my mouth and this meditation of my heart be pleasing in your sight, LORD, my Rock and my Redeemer.', NOW()),
  ('WORKS', 'Ephesians 2:10', 'For we are God''s handiwork, created in Christ Jesus to do good works, which God prepared in advance for us to do.', NOW()),
  ('WORLD', 'John 3:16', 'For God so loved the world that he gave his one and only Son.', NOW()),
  ('WORRY', 'Matthew 6:34', 'Therefore do not worry about tomorrow, for tomorrow will worry about itself. Each day has enough trouble of its own.', NOW()),
  ('WORTH', 'Romans 8:18', 'I consider that our present sufferings are not worth comparing with the glory that will be revealed in us.', NOW()),
  ('WOUND', 'Isaiah 53:5', 'But he was pierced for our transgressions, he was crushed for our iniquities; the punishment that brought us peace was on him, and by his wounds we are healed.', NOW()),
  ('WRITE', 'Habakkuk 2:2', 'Then the LORD replied: Write down the revelation and make it plain on tablets so that a herald may run with it.', NOW()),
  ('YOUNG', 'Psalm 119:9', 'How can a young person stay on the path of purity? By living according to your word.', NOW()),
  ('YOURS', 'Psalm 24:1', 'The earth is the LORD''s, and everything in it.', NOW()),
